    old "Not that. I decide how far this goes, and it isn't there yet."
    new "Eso no. Yo decido hasta dónde llega esto, y todavía no llega ahí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Patience. Something has to change between us before you get that."
    new "Paciencia. Algo tiene que cambiar entre nosotros antes de que tengas eso."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not that. That part of me you haven't won yet."
    new "Eso no. Esa parte de mí todavía no la has conquistado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. There are still a few lines I haven't crossed. That's one of them."
    new "No. Todavía hay algunos límites que no he cruzado. Ese es uno de ellos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Greedy boy. That one you'll have to wait for."
    new "Chico codicioso. Eso vas a tener que esperarlo."

