translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "In front of him? We leave separately, or not at all."
    new "¿Frente a él? Salimos por separado, o no salimos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not together. Not where he can watch us leave."
    new "Juntos no. No donde él pueda vernos salir."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Your father is sitting RIGHT there. Say that again and I'll make sure he hears every word."
    new "Tu padre está sentado JUSTO AHÍ. Repite eso y me aseguraré de que escuche cada palabra."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Have you lost your mind? That man is your FATHER. And I am his WIFE."
    new "¿Perdiste la cabeza? Ese hombre es tu PADRE. Y yo soy su ESPOSA."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I'm going to assume that was a very bad joke. For your sake. Now be quiet."
    new "Voy a suponer que fue una broma de muy mal gusto. Por tu bien. Ahora guarda silencio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not another word. If I repeated what you just said, this family would be over by dinner."
    new "Ni una palabra más. Si repitiera lo que acabas de decir, esta familia se acabaría antes de la cena."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Go somewhere? With you? Your father is right here. Ask HIM to entertain you."
    new "¿Ir a algún lugar? ¿Contigo? Tu padre está aquí mismo. Pídele a ÉL que te entretenga."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. Family outings happen when I schedule them, and I didn't."
    new "No. Las salidas en familia ocurren cuando yo las programo, y no programé ninguna."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Say that again, louder, with your father three steps away. No? Then sit down and be quiet."
    new "Repite eso, más fuerte, con tu padre a tres pasos. ¿No? Entonces siéntate y guarda silencio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You don't have the nerve to repeat that in front of him. Silence suits you better, boy."
    new "No tienes el valor de repetir eso delante de él. El silencio te sienta mejor, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "One word from me and your father handles you himself. Choose your next sentence carefully."
    new "Una palabra mía y tu padre se encarga de ti en persona. Elige con cuidado tu próxima frase."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Do you hear yourself? I married your FATHER. This conversation is over."
    new "¿Te estás escuchando? Me casé con tu PADRE. Esta conversación terminó."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I'm going to pretend those words never left your mouth. Don't make me hear them twice."
    new "Voy a fingir que esas palabras nunca salieron de tu boca. No me hagas oírlas dos veces."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "What exactly do you think I am to you? Ask me again and your father hears about it."
    new "¿Qué crees exactamente que soy para ti? Vuelve a pedírmelo y tu padre se entera."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Hands. Off. I'm not one of your little girlfriends, I'm your father's wife."
    new "Quita. Las. Manos. No soy una de tus noviecitas, soy la esposa de tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Put that hand on me again and you'll be explaining it to your father."
    new "Vuelve a ponerme esa mano encima y vas a tener que explicárselo a tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Kiss you? I'd slap you before you got anywhere near me."
    new "¿Besarte? Te daría una bofetada antes de que siquiera te acercaras a mí."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You want to kiss your father's wife. Say that out loud, hear how it sounds, and never say it again."
    new "Quieres besar a la esposa de tu padre. Dilo en voz alta, escucha cómo suena, y no lo vuelvas a decir nunca."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. Kisses belong to the man I married. Don't bring this up again."
    new "No. Los besos le pertenecen al hombre con el que me casé. No vuelvas a sacar el tema."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A pet name. For your father's wife. Do you even hear yourself?"
    new "Un apodo cariñoso. Para la esposa de tu padre. ¿Siquiera te estás escuchando?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. My name works perfectly fine, and so does yours."
    new "No. Mi nombre funciona perfectamente bien, y el tuyo también."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "We are not that kind of anything, you and I. Use my name."
    new "No somos nada de ese tipo, tú y yo. Usa mi nombre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You asked me to WHAT? Get out. Now."
    new "¿Me pediste que hiciera QUÉ? Vete. Ahora."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I should wash your mouth out with soap. Never ask me that again."
    new "Debería lavarte la boca con jabón. No vuelvas a pedirme eso nunca."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "That you can even form that sentence about your father's wife... unbelievable. No."
    new "Que siquiera puedas formular esa frase sobre la esposa de tu padre... increíble. No."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My hands are never going anywhere near you, boy. Ever."
    new "Mis manos nunca se van a acercar a ti, chico. Jamás."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You asked your stepmother for THAT? I don't know whether to laugh or call your father."
    new "¿Le pediste ESO a tu madrastra? No sé si reírme o llamar a tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. And that you thought you could ask tells me your father has been far too soft on you."
    new "No. Y que creyeras que podías pedirlo me dice que tu padre ha sido demasiado blando contigo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My MOUTH? You must have lost your mind on the way home."
    new "¿Mi BOCA? Debes haber perdido la cabeza camino a casa."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I won't even repeat what you just asked me. Out. NOW."
    new "Ni siquiera voy a repetir lo que acabas de pedirme. Fuera. AHORA."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Boys your age really think they can say anything. No. Never. Not in this lifetime."
    new "Los chicos de tu edad de verdad creen que pueden decir cualquier cosa. No. Nunca. Ni en esta vida."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Sleep with you? With my husband's SON? You're insane."
    new "¿Acostarme contigo? ¿Con el HIJO de mi esposo? Estás loco."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I'm going to say this once. I am your father's wife. Nothing on this earth makes that happen."
    new "Lo voy a decir una sola vez. Soy la esposa de tu padre. Nada en este mundo hará que eso pase."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You just asked your stepmother for sex. Sit with that sentence. Then go to your room."
    new "Acabas de pedirle sexo a tu madrastra. Reflexiona sobre esa frase. Luego vete a tu cuarto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "...I don't know what disgusts me more, the request or where you aimed it."
    new "...No sé qué me da más asco, la petición o adónde apuntaste."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "THAT? You asked ME for THAT? Get out before I say something we'll both regret."
    new "¿ESO? ¿Me pediste ESO a MÍ? Vete antes de que diga algo de lo que los dos nos arrepintamos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "There is something wrong with you. Truly. Get out of my sight."
    new "Algo anda mal contigo. De verdad. Fuera de mi vista."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Go somewhere? With you? I don't have the time, and you don't have the standing."
    new "¿Ir a algún lugar? ¿Contigo? Yo no tengo tiempo, y tú no estás a la altura."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. Being family doesn't make us company for each other."
    new "No. Que seamos familia no significa que tengamos que hacernos compañía."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I go where I decide, with whom I decide. Keep walking, boy."
    new "Voy adonde yo decido, con quien yo decido. Sigue caminando, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. And the next time you forget who commands this house, you'll lose more than your allowance."
    new "No. Y la próxima vez que olvides quién manda en esta casa, vas a perder más que tu mesada."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You mistake me for something you can have. I decide what you get, boy. You get nothing."
    new "Me confundes con algo que puedes tener. Yo decido lo que recibes, chico. No recibes nada."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I give orders in this house. I don't take requests. Especially not that one."
    new "En esta casa, yo doy órdenes. No acepto peticiones. Mucho menos esa."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "That hand. I decide what touches me, and you are not on any list. Remove it."
    new "Esa mano. Yo decido qué me toca, y tú no estás en ninguna lista. Quítala."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Touch me without permission again and you'll learn exactly who runs this family."
    new "Vuelve a tocarme sin permiso y vas a aprender exactamente quién manda en esta familia."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Names between us are my decision, not yours. And I've decided: no."
    new "Los nombres entre nosotros son decisión mía, no tuya. Y ya decidí: no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A nickname. From you. The terms in this house are mine, boy, and the terms are no."
    new "Un apodo. De ti. En esta casa las condiciones son mías, chico, y mis condiciones son: no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A show. For you. I don't perform, boy. People obey me, that's the whole arrangement."
    new "Un espectáculo. Para ti. Yo no me exhibo, chico. La gente me obedece, y ese es todo el trato."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I don't perform. Certainly not for a boy who can't keep his own grades standing."
    new "No me exhibo. Mucho menos para un chico que ni siquiera puede evitar que sus propias notas se derrumben."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "These hands sign your allowance. That is the only thing they will ever do for you."
    new "Estas manos firman tu mesada. Nunca harán nada más por ti."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. My hands do what I decide, for whom I decide. You're not on the list, boy."
    new "No. Mis manos hacen lo que yo decido, por quien yo decido. Tú no estás en la lista, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You just asked the woman who runs this house to KNEEL. Think very carefully about your next sentence."
    new "Acabas de pedirle a la mujer que manda en esta casa que se ARRODILLE. Piensa muy bien tu próxima frase."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My mouth gives orders. That is all it will ever give you."
    new "Mi boca da órdenes. Es lo único que te dará jamás."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Sex. With you. I don't entertain children, and I certainly don't sleep with my husband's son."
    new "Sexo. Contigo. No entretengo a niños, y mucho menos me acuesto con el hijo de mi esposo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. I belong to no one, boy. Least of all to someone I could break with one phone call."
    new "No. No le pertenezco a nadie, chico. Mucho menos a alguien a quien podría destruir con una sola llamada."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "The audacity is almost impressive. Almost. The answer is the door."
    new "La audacia es casi impresionante. Casi. La respuesta es la puerta."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "That's what you ask the woman who runs your life? You can't even meet my eyes when I'm angry."
    new "¿Eso le pides a la mujer que manda en tu vida? Ni siquiera puedes mirarme a los ojos cuando estoy enojada."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I don't follow, boy. And I certainly don't follow you."
    new "Yo no sigo a nadie, chico. Y mucho menos a ti."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You want me walking behind you? Learn the order of this house first."
    new "¿Quieres que camine detrás de ti? Primero aprende la jerarquía de esta casa."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Ask me again and I will make your life harder than you can imagine. Try me."
    new "Vuelve a pedírmelo y haré tu vida más difícil de lo que puedes imaginar. Ponme a prueba."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. And if you push, I push back. I always push back harder."
    new "No. Y si me presionas, contraataco. Siempre contraataco con más fuerza."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You've mistaken me for someone patient. I'm not. Drop it, now."
    new "Me confundiste con alguien paciente. No lo soy. Déjalo, ahora."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. I'm saying it gently because I'd rather keep this house civil. Don't ask again."
    new "No. Te lo digo con suavidad porque prefiero mantener la cordialidad en esta casa. No vuelvas a pedirlo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I'm not angry, I'm something worse. Disappointed. Never bring this up again."
    new "No estoy enojada, es algo peor. Decepcionada. No vuelvas a sacar este tema nunca."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You're getting a soft 'no' exactly once. The next one won't be soft."
    new "Solo vas a recibir un 'no' amable una vez. El siguiente no lo será."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "That is not appropriate. It will never be appropriate. Please stop."
    new "Eso no es apropiado. Nunca va a ser apropiado. Por favor, ya basta."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I... am going to leave now, and we will both pretend this conversation never happened."
    new "Yo... me voy a ir ahora, y los dos vamos a fingir que esta conversación nunca ocurrió."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Don't do this. Some things can't be unsaid, and that was nearly one of them."
    new "No hagas esto. Hay cosas que, una vez dichas, no tienen vuelta atrás, y esa casi fue una de ellas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Greedy. I set the pace, boy. You take what I give and you say thank you."
    new "Codicioso. Yo marco el ritmo, chico. Tomas lo que te doy y das las gracias."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. When you've pleased me enough, I'll tell you. Until then, don't ask."
    new "No. Cuando me hayas complacido lo suficiente, te lo diré. Hasta entonces, no lo pidas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You'll get that the day I decide you've earned it. Today is not that day."
    new "Tendrás eso el día en que yo decida que te lo ganaste. Hoy no es ese día."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not that. Even now, there are parts of me you haven't earned."
    new "Eso no. Incluso ahora, hay partes de mí que no te has ganado."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. I still decide where the lines are, and that one stands."
    new "No. Todavía soy yo quien decide dónde están los límites, y ese se mantiene."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "...Hand me my things. And fix your face before anyone sees you."
    new "...Pásame mis cosas. Y arregla esa cara antes de que alguien te vea."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not a word of this outside this room. Not one."
    new "Ni una palabra de esto fuera de estas cuatro paredes. Ni una."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "...Stay there a moment. Just a moment. Then we never speak of how much I wanted that."
    new "...Quédate ahí un momento. Solo un momento. Después nunca hablaremos de cuánto lo deseaba."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I think about this more than I'll ever admit to you. There. That's all you get."
    new "Pienso en esto más de lo que jamás te voy a admitir. Ya está. Es todo lo que te llevas."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "One of these days we'll be careless and burn this family down. ...Why doesn't that stop me."
    new "Uno de estos días vamos a descuidarnos y a reducir esta familia a cenizas. ...No sé por qué eso no me detiene."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Every time, I swear it's the last time. And every time I'm already planning the next one."
    new "Cada vez juro que es la última. Y cada vez ya estoy planeando la siguiente."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "...I did everything you said. I don't know what's happening to me, and I don't want it explained."
    new "...Hice todo lo que me dijiste. No sé qué me está pasando, y no quiero que me lo expliquen."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Tell me to leave. ...No. Don't. Don't tell me anything for a minute."
    new "Dime que me vaya. ...No. No lo digas. No me digas nada por un minuto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You got what your little videos paid for. Enjoy it while it lasts, boy."
    new "Ya tienes lo que compraron tus videítos. Disfrútalo mientras dure, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Don't mistake this for wanting you. We have an arrangement. That's all this is."
    new "No confundas esto con desearte. Tenemos un acuerdo. Esto no es más que eso."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "...I'll shower at home. His soap, his towels, and not one thought about him."
    new "...Me ducharé en casa. Su jabón, sus toallas, y ni un solo pensamiento para él."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Look at me. Whatever happens, this does not end. Understood?"
    new "Mírame. Pase lo que pase, esto no termina. ¿Entendido?"

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Twenty years I ran my life like a ledger. Then you. ...Don't you dare repeat that."
    new "Durante veinte años llevé mi vida como un libro de cuentas. Luego llegaste tú. ...No te atrevas a repetir eso."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I'm yours. I hate the word, and it's the only one that fits."
    new "Soy tuya. Odio la palabra, y es la única que encaja."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "In his home. Again. I should feel something about that, and all I feel is your hands."
    new "En su casa. Otra vez. Debería sentir algo al respecto, y lo único que siento son tus manos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "One day I'll stop being careful. Pray you're worth it, because I already know I won't stop."
    new "Un día voy a dejar de tener cuidado. Reza para que valgas la pena, porque ya sé que no voy a parar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Whatever you want next, say it and it happens. That's what I am now. ...Start with something small."
    new "Lo que quieras después, dilo y sucede. Eso es lo que soy ahora. ...Empieza por algo pequeño."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Order me to rest. If it's an order, I might actually do it."
    new "Ordéname que descanse. Si es una orden, quizá de verdad lo haga."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-10-03 20:54

translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A photo. Of me. On your phone. I can already see the headline, boy. Delete this conversation."
    new "Una foto. Mía. En tu celular. Ya puedo ver el titular, chico. Borra esta conversación."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I pose for shareholder reports. Ask again and your father reads this chat."
    new "Yo poso para informes de accionistas. Pídelo otra vez y tu padre leerá este chat."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. And if my face ever leaves your phone, my lawyers will live in your dorm."
    new "No. Y si mi cara alguna vez sale de tu celular, mis abogados van a vivir en tu dormitorio."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "OUT. This is MY bathroom, in MY house, and that door had a lock for a reason."
    new "FUERA. Este es MI baño, en MI casa, y esa puerta tenía cerrojo por una razón."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Join me? I'll count to three, and at two I'm calling your father."
    new "¿Ducharte conmigo? Voy a contar hasta tres, y en el dos llamo a tu padre."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You walked in on your father's wife in the shower and asked THAT. Get out and pray I forget it."
    new "Irrumpiste en la ducha de la esposa de tu padre y encima pediste ESO. Vete y reza para que lo olvide."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "...This bathroom has an occupied side and a hallway side. Learn the difference. I'm taking the hallway."
    new "...Este baño tiene un lado ocupado y un lado de pasillo. Aprende la diferencia. Yo me quedo con el pasillo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Cover yourself. This is a bathroom, not a statement."
    new "Cúbrete. Esto es un baño, no un manifiesto."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Noted: the lock works and you don't use it. That's a you problem, boy."
    new "Anotado: el cerrojo funciona y tú no lo usas. Eso es problema tuyo, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "People petition ME for pictures, boy. And they get told no by an assistant."
    new "A MÍ la gente me solicita fotos, chico. Y quien les dice que no es una asistente."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My image is an asset. Assets don't go to boys' phones. Ever."
    new "Mi imagen es un activo. Los activos no terminan en celulares de chicos. Jamás."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You don't walk in on me. I summon. That's the entire system, and you just failed it."
    new "Tú no irrumpes en mi ducha. Yo convoco. Ese es todo el sistema, y acabas de reprobar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Out. In this house even the water answers to me, and so do you."
    new "Fuera. En esta casa hasta el agua me obedece, y tú también."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Stand there dripping if you like. I needed the mirror, not the view."
    new "Quédate ahí goteando, si quieres. Necesitaba el espejo, no la vista."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Relax, boy. I audit everything in this house. Nothing I see changes my numbers."
    new "Relájate, chico. Audito todo en esta casa. Nada de lo que veo cambia mis números."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Yes. However you want it. Just keep telling me."
    new "Sí. Como tú quieras. Solo sigue diciéndome cómo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Alright. ...Direct me. It's easier when you do."
    new "Está bien. ...Guíame. Es más fácil cuando lo haces tú."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My hands used to sign everything in this house. Tell them what to do now."
    new "Mis manos firmaban todo en esta casa. Ahora diles qué hacer."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I used to give orders with this mouth. ...On my knees, then. Say when."
    new "Yo daba órdenes con esta boca. ...De rodillas, entonces. Dime cuándo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Take me, then. I stopped pretending I'd say no a while ago."
    new "Entonces tómame. Hace tiempo que dejé de fingir que diría que no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I... can't. Not right now. Please don't be angry with me."
    new "Yo... no puedo. Ahora no. Por favor, no te enojes conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not here. I'm sorry. Ask me again somewhere safer and I won't refuse."
    new "Aquí no. Lo siento. Pídemelo otra vez en un lugar más seguro y no me voy a negar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I want to say yes. I always want to say yes now. ...Just not here. Please."
    new "Quiero decir que sí. Ahora siempre quiero decir que sí. ...Solo que no aquí. Por favor."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Don't look at me like that, I'll fold. ...Later. I promise you later."
    new "No me mires así, que voy a ceder. ...Más tarde. Te lo prometo: más tarde."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "He's RIGHT there... please. It's the one no I have left. Don't make me spend it."
    new "Está JUSTO AHÍ... por favor. Es el único no que me queda. No me hagas gastarlo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not in front of him. Please. Everywhere else I'm yours, you know that."
    new "Delante de él no. Por favor. En cualquier otro lugar soy tuya, lo sabes."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "With him home? I'll make an excuse tomorrow and meet you anywhere. Just not under his eyes."
    new "¿Con él en casa? Mañana invento una excusa y te veo donde sea. Solo que no en sus narices."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Tell me I did well. ...I know how that sounds. Say it anyway."
    new "Dime que lo hice bien. ...Sé cómo suena eso. Dilo de todos modos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I used to run this house. Now I lie here hoping you're pleased. I've decided not to examine that."
    new "Yo dirigía esta casa. Ahora estoy aquí acostada, esperando que estés complacido. Decidí no analizar eso."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Whatever you need next, it's yours. That's not an offer, it's just... what I am now."
    new "Lo que necesites después, es tuyo. No es una oferta, es solo... lo que soy ahora."

