    new "¿Mi número? Es para tu padre, mi consejo directivo y mi abogado. Tú no eres ninguno de ellos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You have a roof, meals and an allowance. None of them requires my number."
    new "Tienes un techo, comida y una mesada. Nada de eso requiere mi número."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "If it's urgent, tell your father. If it's not, don't bother me at all."
    new "Si es urgente, díselo a tu padre. Si no, no me molestes para nada."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "People earn a line to me, boy. You haven't even earned the right to knock."
    new "Una línea directa conmigo se gana, chico. Tú ni siquiera te has ganado el derecho a tocar la puerta."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "My number goes to people I summon. You get summoned. Learn the difference."
    new "Mi número es para la gente que yo convoco. A ti se te convoca. Aprende la diferencia."

