    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No condom, no me. Pick one."
    new "Sin condón, no me tienes. Elige."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You go in wrapped, boy. That's the price of me, and I set it."
    new "Entras con condón, chico. Ese es mi precio, y lo pongo yo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Bare is a privilege. You haven't been granted it. Condom."
    new "Sin condón es un privilegio. No se te ha concedido. Condón."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I'm yours. That doesn't mean everything is, not yet."
    new "Soy tuya. Eso no significa que todo lo sea, todavía no."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not that. There's one wall left, and you're not knocking it down today."
    new "Eso no. Queda un muro, y hoy no lo vas a derribar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Greedy. You have me. Let me keep a little something for later."
    new "Codicioso. Ya me tienes. Déjame guardar algo para después."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Condom. I'm yours, not careless."
    new "Condón. Soy tuya, no descuidada."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I said I'm yours. I never said bare. Put it on."
    new "Dije que soy tuya. Nunca dije sin condón. Póntelo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Not without one. Not yet. Wrap it, or we stop right here."
    new "Sin condón no. Todavía no. Póntelo, o paramos aquí mismo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I gave you a lot, boy. The rest is still mine to give."
    new "Te di mucho, chico. Lo demás todavía lo doy yo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. Even now, that line is mine to move, not yours."
    new "No. Incluso ahora, ese límite lo muevo yo, no tú."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Wrapped, boy. I'm yours on my terms, and that's one of them."
    new "Con condón, chico. Soy tuya en mis términos, y ese es uno de ellos."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You want me bare? Earn it. Until then, a condom."
    new "¿Me quieres sin condón? Gánatelo. Hasta entonces, condón."

