translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A dinner date? With my husband's son? That sentence alone could burn this family down. Never say it again."
    new "¿Una cita para cenar? ¿Con el hijo de mi esposo? Esa sola frase podría incendiar a esta familia. No vuelvas a decirla jamás."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I have dinners with boards and investors, boy. Not with a student who lives on my husband's money."
    new "Yo ceno con juntas directivas e inversionistas, chico. No con un estudiante que vive del dinero de mi esposo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "We share a table on Sundays, as a family. That is every dinner you will ever get from me."
    new "Compartimos la mesa los domingos, en familia. Esas son todas las cenas que vas a tener conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "You don't invite me, boy. The day I want you somewhere, you'll be told the time, the place, and what to wear."
    new "Tú no me invitas, chico. El día que te quiera en algún sitio, se te informará la hora, el lugar y qué ponerte."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A date. You, planning MY evening. I schedule this family's lives, yours included. Know your place."
    new "Una cita. Tú, planeando MI noche. Yo organizo la vida de esta familia, la tuya incluida. Conoce tu lugar."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "A restaurant? Where this whole city can SEE us? Use your head, boy."
    new "¿Un restaurante? ¿Donde toda la ciudad pueda VERNOS? Usa la cabeza, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "No. Whatever this is, it does not sit at a candlelit table in public. Ask me that again and it becomes nothing."
    new "No. Sea lo que sea esto, no se sienta a una mesa a la luz de las velas en público. Pídemelo otra vez y deja de existir."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "Outside these walls I am his wife. You don't get to forget that because I let you close once."
    new "Fuera de estas paredes soy su esposa. No puedes olvidarlo solo porque una vez te dejé acercarte."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "I decide when we are seen together. The answer is never, and you don't get a vote, boy."
    new "Yo decido cuándo nos ven juntos. La respuesta es nunca, y no tienes voto, chico."

    # game/scripts/Dialogs/stepmom_sex_lines.rpy:44
    old "What I allow you happens where I say, behind doors I choose. A restaurant is you showing me off. Nobody shows me off."
    new "Lo que te permito pasa donde yo digo, tras puertas que yo elijo. En un restaurante me estarías presumiendo. A mí nadie me presume."

